cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Sudmex Morphine: Code Logbook for Morphine Effects in Sudmex Rats"
authors:
  - family-names: "Neuropsytox"
    given-names: "Research Team"
    affiliation: "Neuropsytox Research Group"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neuropsytox/Sudmex_morphine"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - morphine
  - rat model
  - MRI
  - behavioral analysis
  - neuroimaging
  - addiction research
abstract: >
  This repository contains the complete code logbook and analysis 
  pipeline for studying morphine effects in Sudmex rats. It includes 
  behavioral assessments, structural and functional MRI analyses, and 
  multivariate statistical approaches for investigating brain-behavior 
  relationships.
